r.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"37:28","t":"They will say, \"Indeed, you used to come at us from the right.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"37:29","t":"They [i.e., the oppressors] will say, \"Rather, you [yourselves] were not believers,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"37:30","t":"And we had over you no authority, but you were a transgressing people.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"37:31","t":"So the word [i.e., decree] of our Lord has come into effect upon us; indeed, we will taste [punishment].","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"37:32","t":"And we led you to deviation; indeed, we were deviators.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"37:33","t":"So indeed they, that Day, will be sharing in the punishment.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"37:34","t":"Indeed, that is how We deal with the criminals.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"37:35","t":"Indeed they, when it was said to them, \"There is no deity but Allāh,\" were arrogant","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"37:36","t":"And were saying, \"Are we to leave our gods for a mad poet?\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"37:37","t":"Rather, he [i.e., the Prophet (ﷺ)] has come with the truth and confirmed the [previous] messengers.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"37:38","t":"Indeed, you [disbelievers] will be tasters of the painful punishment,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"37:39","t":"And you will not be recompensed except for what you used to do -","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"37:40","t":"But not the chosen servants of Allāh.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"37:41","t":"Those will have a provision determined -","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"37:42","t":"Fruits; and they will be honored","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"37:43","t":"In gardens of pleasure","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"37:44","t":"On thrones facing one another.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"37:45","t":"There will be circulated among them a cup [of wine] from a flowing spring,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"37:46","t":"White and delicious to the drinkers;","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"37:47","t":"No bad effect is there in it, nor from it will they be intoxicated.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"37:48","t":"And with them will be women limiting [their] glances, with large, [beautiful] eyes,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"37:49","t":"As if they were [delicate] eggs, well-protected.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"37:50","t":"And they will approach one another, inquiring of each other.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"37:51","t":"A speaker among them will say, \"Indeed, I had a companion [on earth].","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[37],"sajdah":false}